Dear Sir / Madam,
Pursuant to Regulation 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations And Disclosure Requirements) Regulations,2015, we are submitting herewith Unaudited Standalone & Consolidated Financial Results for thequarter and half year ended on 30th September, 2026 as approved by the Board of Directors of theCompany along-with Auditors' Limited Review Report at its meeting held today.
The meeting of the Board of Directors commenced at 7.00 pm and concluded at 10.00 pm.We request you to kindly take the above information on record.
Thanks & Regards,Yours faithfully,
